{"3774170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Retro Basketball Manager", "steam_appid": 3774170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CUSTOMIZE THE WORLD</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the editor to create or edit players, coaches and teams. You can also use downloaded databases!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774170/extras/535e3b71dec7df713ecd752fbcbad195.avif?t=1751274599\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774170/extras_big/535e3b71dec7df713ecd752fbcbad195.avif?t=1751274599 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>MAKE CAREER MOVES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a team, national team or unemployed and look for offers from other teams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774170/extras/3496bbb14c9a04534f71d5f0bec2d75c.avif?t=1751274599\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774170/extras_big/3496bbb14c9a04534f71d5f0bec2d75c.avif?t=1751274599 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CHANGE YOUR TACTICS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your lineup, playbook and defensive instructions. Watch or sim games to see if they work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774170/extras/ecbf329f715fed21710828dcf2815d6b.poster.avif?t=1751274599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774170/extras/